>
> **RECORD-ASSEMBLY LEMMA.** If, for fixed \(T\), the supplier theorems prove the five field propositions \(P_{M0}(T),\ldots,P_{M4}(T)\), then they prove
> \[
> P_{M0}(T)\times P_{M1}(T)\times P_{M2}(T)\times
